KONOHAGAKURE — SQUAD ROSTER: TEAM 7

Jonin-sensei: Hatake, Kakashi (the "Copy Ninja")
Genin:
- Uzumaki, Naruto — Wind nature; Shadow Clone Jutsu. Aspires to Hokage.
- Uchiha, Sasuke — Sharingan; Fire-natured techniques. Rookie of the Year.
- Haruno, Sakura — Superb chakra control; medical-nin aptitude.

Formation notes: A balanced offensive cell built around Sasuke's assault, Naruto's numbers and stamina, and Sakura's control and analysis, coordinated by Kakashi. Passed the bell test on the principle that those who abandon comrades are worse than trash.

Notable missions: Land of Waves escort (Tazuna) — engaged Zabuza Momochi and Haku, exceeding C-rank scope.
Status: Active (genin), preparing for Chunin Selection Exams.
Filed by the Mission Assignment Desk.
